<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-16537] Ducktests fail because of new format of control.sh </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16537</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Output format of the control.sh utility has been changed in PR &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In particular the dataCenterId is now printed for GridCacheVersion in the &quot;--tx --info xxx&quot; command.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This causes the failure of ducktests which is unable to parse control.sh output now. In particular this one &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;control.sh output parser should be fixed to support both old and new format.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/9766&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/9766&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; - &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/blob/master/modules/ducktests/tests/ignitetest/tests/control_utility/tx_test.py&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/blob/master/modules/ducktests/tests/ignitetest/tests/control_utility/tx_test.py&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
